      "updated": 1793802311476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vitest - The actual test runner\njsdom - gives a fake/headless browser to render DOM into\n@testing-library/react - how we render components and query the DOM\n@testing-library/jest-dom - Extends the matchers that are available\n@testing-library/user-event - Extends the interaction helpers that are available\nmsw - Mock Service Worker, allows you to easily intercept and mock fetch responses",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vitest - The actual test runner\njsdom - gives a fake/headless browser to render DOM into\n@testing-library/react - how we render components and query the DOM\n@testing-library/jest-dom - Extends the matchers that are available\n@testing-library/user-event - Extends the interaction helpers that are available\nmsw - Mock Service Worker, allows you to easily intercept and mock fetch responses",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
